amily: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><section style="vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 0.5px;line-height: normal;"><span style="outline: 0px;text-indent: 2em;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);">是对我们最大的支持~</span></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">长寿是我们每个人都向往的，毕竟人生很短。公认的长寿秘诀需要具备诸多因素，比如居住环境、饮食、作息、运动、遗传等，上述条件我们很难说到底哪个是长寿的必要因素，可能这些都很重要，但最重要的因素目前各有各的说法。但不可否认，居住在世界各大宗教场所的人很多都很长寿。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107463" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="display: inline-block;margin-right: 3px;margin-left: 3px;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 252, 249) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;padding: 7px 22px;transform: translate(-3px, -3px);"><section data-brushtype="text" style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;" hm_fix="292:243"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>一<span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">、</span>养生三要素</strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">从医那么多年，非常关注健康养生。毕竟中医的最高境界是养生 -- 中医来自道家。青城山的小住、寺庙的小歇，让我发现三大要素及其重要：<span style="font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">心态、饮食、茶</span>。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;">心态需要我们后天的修炼，而道家佛家特别讲究清淡饮食、讲究素食，同时后者——茶，确是所有修行人日常、也是几乎每天都饮用的。禅门有句老话：</span><em><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">吃茶去</span></strong></span></em><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;">。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">茶在中国有四千多年悠久的历史，《神农本草经》、《史记》中都有记载，“</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">日遇七十二毒，得茶而解之</span></strong></span><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">”，可见茶在中草药中的地位有多高。从古自今，茶已经是人们的生活必须品。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6196319018404908" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvQPxicMHfEk5ToCe1w84ykrZSWwLPZhFy4CiaeCzZ10bLnDaUhQWyaw8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="484" data-width="85%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 85%;" width="85%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">身处红尘，每日的事情越来越多，身体却是一天天老去，很多事情又不得不为。周遭的人在红尘中加速老去、病去，虽然知道人生离不开生老病死。今天我们努力工作学习，其实都想过得好些，都想给家人一份舒适的环境，我们寄托于美好的明天。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;">身体对我们来说极为重要。一旦身体出问题，一切归零，而且让生者更为痛苦。很多时候我们努力的背后，是加速自己的身体衰亡。看似为了家人，实则对己对他都是一种最大的伤害，这一切来自我们浅陋的智慧。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">这个时代，是个什么都不缺，就缺福德智慧的时代。</span></strong></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107463" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="display: inline-block;margin-right: 3px;margin-left: 3px;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 252, 249) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;padding: 7px 22px;transform: translate(-3px, -3px);"><section data-brushtype="text" style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;" hm_fix="303:235"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>二<span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">、</span>小医生讲茶</strong></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">因为曾在一些私人顶级养生会所从医的经验，总结了一些日常大家的生活规律，推荐一些简单的养生方法，今天就讲“茶”。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;"><br  /></span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">我们知道六大茶类：</span><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">绿茶、青茶、红茶、白茶、黄茶、黑茶</span>。</span></strong></span><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: #3E3E3E;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">这个分类，是复旦茶学四大宗师之一的陈椽教授，在</span><span style="color: #3E3E3E;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">1979</span>年时确定的。</span></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);"><br  /></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;">中医讲“<strong><span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">炁里形表</span></strong>”，<strong>“炁”是在里面运行的规律，“形”是在表面可见的结构</strong>。<span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">“炁”是茶最关键的问题</span>。</span><span style="font-size: 16px;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">我们讲一个茶好，到底怎么好？味道好？好喝、香？那不如喝果汁。</span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="font-size: 16px;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;"><strong><br  /></strong></span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 0in;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="font-size: 16px;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;"><strong>茶的好在于它内在的“炁”</strong><strong>。而一个好茶一定离不开先天的茶种，后天的生长、阳光、温度、水，最后制作者独具一格的匠心。尤其是后者，它需要传承，需要历经几十年的沉淀。</strong></span></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;" hm_fix="292:523"><em><strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title="" title="">1</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>“炁”与“气”</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">茶真正的好处就是这个？</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">好的茶，喝后有“立竿见影”的舒适感。<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">喝不同的茶有不同的感受，主要有“发热、发汗”的感觉，身体立马就“通透”的感觉</span>。</span></strong></span><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">这种感觉就是“炁”，这个“炁”是一种特殊的能量流。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: center;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvQuPZjrKSL9DbTHqrahaIRibrZ5tLiaSicVPBYXwmyTdsoPQGZ8ia577lvw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="720" data-width="50%" style="vertical-align: inherit;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;width: 289px;" width="50%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">我们中医讲阴阳,讲五行。</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">阴阳是“炁”的属性分类，五行是“脏腑结构”的属性分类。它是两套不同的体系，是互补的</span></span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"></span><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">。</span></span><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">中医关注的是经络，就是“炁”，这里称为“气”，气通过经络在走动。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">气也有阴阳，有升降气也能转换血，叫“</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">气生血</span></strong></span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">”。<span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">气不是单单是“阳”，它也是“阴”。</span>我们怕搞混大家，所以一直说“阳”，这点大家要注意下。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4570552147239264" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvOKJ68dkic6ycIgticbU5F1kNwVZiadicdROrx3Su0PFWgYicSueFkgh5jpw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="640" data-width="85%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 85%;" width="85%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">《黄帝内经》里分为天、人、地三气。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">天降之气我们叫做“<em>卫气</em>”，在经络之外保卫我们，所以叫做“卫气”。</span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><br  /></span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">人传之气叫做“<em>宗气</em>”，宗族血脉之气，祖上传下来的，走的是奇经八脉。</span></strong></span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">所以大家不要忘本，中国几千年的历史都是很客观的，大家不要不信。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">地产之气是营养之气，所以叫做“<em>营气</em>”，营气进入的是正脉。</span></strong></span><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">正脉穿过脏腑，分</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">12</span>个经络<span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">、</span>6个脉；每个脉是分两根经，所以一共12个经络。</span></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">而<span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">茶里面是营气 -- 营养之气，前面说了营气进入到正脉，正好通过经络进入脏腑。</span></span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;" hm_fix="292:523"><em><strong>02</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>“阴阳”与“三才”</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">茶的不同加工方式，会产生不同成分。加工方式里有“阴阳”规律和“三才”的规律。茶的制作里有一步非常重要：</span><span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">杀青，通过加热高温或者干燥，让茶叶里的生物酶灭活。</span><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">茶中的成分在杀青前后分出了阴阳。</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">杀青前转化的，叫“<em>阳茶</em>”。杀青以后转化的，叫做“<em>阴茶</em>”，阴茶没有生物酶。黑茶、黄茶、白茶是阴茶，红茶、绿茶、青茶是阳茶。</span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">阴茶里面分三类，阳茶里面又分三类。大家是不是想到了中医里的“三阳三阴”了？</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5828220858895705" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvCT9A3Lt34Vc0yq4FKfibfJMaqraP4NDhaP97gpERmnpJeibDXHHyfcjA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" data-width="85%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 85%;" width="85%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;text-decoration: underline;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 17px;">绿茶</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">，杀青炒一炒。成分来自光合作用，来自<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><strong>天上的阳光</strong></span> -- <em><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">太阳</span></strong></em>。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-decoration: underline;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 17px;">白茶</span></strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">呢？先萎凋晒青，再慢慢地晒，把它晒香。白茶的能量也来自于日光，它慢慢吸收了天上的能量，来自于天。但是它有个特点是，死了再吸收日光，所以叫“<strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">天之阴</span></strong>”——<em><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">太阴</span></strong></em>。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-decoration: underline;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 17px;">青茶</span></strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">呢？摇青，放在竹匾里拼命摇，里边的各种分类在多酚氧化酶的作用下都转化成有机酸，再去锅里杀青，它是人的力气进入到阳茶里面，<span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><strong>人之阳</strong></span>，中医里叫“<em><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">阳明</span></strong></em>”。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-decoration: underline;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 17px;">黑茶</span></strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">，先杀青，然后锅里炒一炒，它转化的关键在于杀青之后的深度揉。人的力气进入阴茶，<strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">人之阴</span></strong>，中医叫“<em><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">厥阴</span></strong></em>”。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6328125" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvCWX1wm0kBlhekHl2oZkFUKVbFA8Hib4Mv7RWankvGeNLFpzlwsLGVug/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="720" style="vertical-align:inherit;"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;">看到这里大家发现一个问题没，茶的好坏除了制作过程，它离不开天时地利人和：天上的阳光、地上的加工、还有人力。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">大家看过一个实验没？水实验，江本胜博士的水实验。心静的人，喝茶的时候能品出泡茶人的茶境。泡一杯好茶需要一些好的硬件，好水、好壶、碳等，但还有一个最为关键的要素 -- 人。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">心境好的人，泡出的水含阴阳之气，有治病疗愈的作用。一个好的品茶人如果对他要求高的话，根据喝的茶可以评判泡茶人的泡茶流程、细节的规范及泡茶时的心境，你的心境都会融入到茶中，所以我经常喜欢去那些心地善良的人那里喝茶，那已经不是茶了是甘露。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">天、地、人里面，“人”最为关键</span><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">。</span></span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">一个好的制茶师父，一定有个好的心境。制茶的技术现在已经很高了，但里面的</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">韵味，好比打拳的气场，不是靠的拳架，靠的是人的魂魄</span>。</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">阴阳要融合，拳要与人融合，茶也要与制茶、泡茶的人融合。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;"><em><strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title="" title="" data-num="3" aria-describedby="tooltip357028" hm_fix="282:523">3</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>老白茶是宝</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">临床那么多年来，全球很多人因为见证了这次疫情看诊的的功力，于是纷纷求治各种疑难杂症，比较多的是恶性肿瘤，而这些病症很多跟现在人的湿气普遍很重有关系。湿气是导致肿瘤癌症的一个重要前因</span><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">，有身体“<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">虚而寒、寒而湿、湿而淤、淤而瘤</span>”之说。</span></span></strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">现今的世界，肿瘤癌症比比皆是。阴阳本来是平衡了，阴多了阳必然少；</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;">湿气重的人，一定是脾出了问题，脾脏归太阴脾经。</span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;text-align: center;"><strong style="font-