SXWbXGcveIvPguckYAHqoPorsbIdiaB3YnlAYVjPbvl7jn737Yxo8qluq1EFjeQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="800" data-width="20%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 20%;" width="20%"  /></p></section><section data-role="paragraph" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;"><br  /></p></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">前面我们说哪个茶归</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">太阴</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">—— </span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">白茶</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">，对了。</span><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">所以身体日常湿气重的人，日常经常乏力的人，白茶可以健脾去湿气，可以破开湿气，升发阳气，让你有种拨开云雾见阳光的感觉。现在人的湿气重主要是饮食肥甘不清淡，熬夜不运动导致</span><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">。</span></span></strong><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">笔者喝白茶多年，六</span><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">大茶中首推白茶，白茶还有一句古话，叫做“</span><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">一年是个茶，三年是个药，七年是个宝</span></strong></span><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">”。我们的祖先很智慧，很早前就已经发现白茶的药性了。<strong>当今的人普遍熬夜，饮食过多，运动缺乏，湿气很重，不生病才怪呢。</strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;" hm_fix="283:536"><em><strong>0</strong><strong data-original-title="" title="" data-num="4">4</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>匠心传承</strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>梅氏老白茶</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0.33in;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0.33in;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">前面说到了茶的制作跟人密切相关，笔者推荐</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">国家级非物质文化遗产项目白茶制作技艺 -- 福鼎白茶制作大师梅相靖老先生。</span><span style="font-size: 16px;caret-color: red;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">梅老是国家级非物质文化遗产，</span><span style="font-size: 16px;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">福鼎白茶制作技艺的当代代表性人物，清著名茶商梅伯珍之孙，梅山派第三代传人。央视《茶-一片树叶的故事》记录片受访者。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0.33in;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><img align="bottom" border="0" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.625" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvlXh9IcRN2ah6hkRqcsvZMzrszBrPwKncTKzQnsb5Ttaxy0kd1c58FA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="384" height="313" style="vertical-align:middle;" width="500"  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0.33in;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">梅老做事精益求精、一丝不苟，早年所有的茶都采用手工亲制。只可惜</span><span style="font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">2018</span><span style="font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">年之后，他不再亲自制做茶了。所以2018年他做的最后那批手工茶，市面上目前已经绝版了，而白茶正以一年20%，第2年30%的价格与日俱增。一些7年以上他做的珍藏版都逼近上万一片了。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">2018年他做的珍藏版 -- 白茶中的牡丹，现在是绝版中的绝版。上半年市场还有少量库存，已经是1480的价格，明年绝对奔大二千了。以后真是喝一块少一块了。目前喝了很多家，从来没有一家能超越梅老的制茶技术，换句话说达不到他制茶的心境。大家如果身边有闲钱的可以不妨多买些。今天喝茶总比明天喝药来得好吧。中医的最高境界在于养生。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;text-align: center;"><mp-miniprogram data-miniprogram-appid="wx32540bd863b27570" data-miniprogram-path="package_c/goods/goods?refer_share_btn=top_forward&amp;_wv=1&amp;xcx_x_zyw=&amp;event_type=0&amp;preloadImgUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fimg.pddpic.com%2Fmms-material-img%2F2021-08-31%2Fa15facfe-cac3-4d9e-8104-4cee185b16c6.jpeg.a.jpeg%3FimageView2%2F2%2Fq%2F50%2Fw%2F400%2Fformat%2Fwebp&amp;share_trace_id=7442626438531039&amp;from_share=1&amp;refer_share_uin=WXCPCD2A5DLTSOW5FNR7PZFMLQ_GEXDA&amp;share_form=custom_card&amp;share_tips=normal_share&amp;goods_type=1&amp;share_time=1637683717974&amp;card_v=v7.9.8&amp;page_from=39&amp;refer_page_sn=10039&amp;_oc_trace_mark=199&amp;refer_share_page=goods&amp;refer_share_id=7xbcIP5xsYTdU9qCS3BtFrO7Ko6yfVqY&amp;share_uin=WXCPCD2A5DLTSOW5FNR7PZFMLQ_GEXDA&amp;goods_price=780&amp;goods_id=275198449253&amp;x_scene=1089&amp;refer_share_uid=2733816450028&amp;refer_share_channel=message&amp;refer_share_source=native&amp;refer_share_pu=FgkvL2a2LPHvQ1CbLSZZ3%23%23sU6" data-miniprogram-nickname="拼多多" data-miniprogram-avatar="http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/I3ht2WMGrPjkBVPwWLHt9LbsXHnXaHKuT6LmFDpvV7jcJSEibYrN1Wc5SpVhRUXxv1vJyCgVETh7m9RRMzYLSiag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=200" data-miniprogram-title="珍藏版 梅相靖老白茶" data-miniprogram-imageurl="http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvLIX0zUZicPbyMU30EYaNjqMN9yHzMYicBfMvWaBJrnHYa54mHXIXIU5g/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-miniprogram-type="card" data-miniprogram-servicetype="0"></mp-miniprogram></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;text-align: center;"><strong style="font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;color: #7f7f7f;">梅氏老白茶（珍藏版）&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(0, 112, 192);">⬆️⬇️ </span>合一基金专营</span></strong></p><section data-role="paragraph" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><p style="text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcveIvPguckYAHqoPorsbIdiaB3YnlAYVjPbvl7jn737Yxo8qluq1EFjeQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="800" data-width="20%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 20%;" width="20%"  /></p></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0.33in;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;">中国皇帝的平均寿命是</span>28岁，虽然吃穿不愁，但每天离不开吃喝。吃喝都由奴才斥候，而奴才的地位往往都很低。想想，天天战战兢兢下做出来的吃喝没毒才怪呢，所以很多皇帝其实是被毒死的。所以我们要对身边的衣食父母要好点，要多尊重身边的人，多感恩帮助你的人。</span><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">今天喝到梅老的茶比皇帝幸运。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;"><em><strong>05</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><br  /></section><section style="font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;"><span style="font-size: 17px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);">存放与冲泡</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">最后我们再说说最后</span><span style="text-indent: 0.33in;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">2种茶。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 17px;">红茶</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">，是揉破了以后堆在地上，盖块湿布让它<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">渥红</span>。</span><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">以前茶学的书说，红茶的转化叫做<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">发酵</span>，是氨基酸脱氢酶反应，氨基酸全脱氢变成了胺类物质，胺类物质就会产生让人非常愉悦的味道和效果。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;">因为胺类的成分是内分泌系统需要的东西，我们多巴胺、五羟色胺各种各样的胺类，都是让我们内分泌变得正常的东西。现在很多人缺少多巴胺，导致帕金森，所以有帕金森的病人可以多喝喝红茶。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;"><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;">红茶是地上堆出来的，是地气进去的，它是“</span><strong style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">地之阳</span></strong><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;">”——</span><em style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">少阳</span></strong></em><span style="text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;">。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;text-indent: 0em;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;text-decoration: underline;font-size: 17px;">黄茶</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;">，先杀青，揉湿了包在湿布里扣在地上闷黄，所以它也是地之气，是“</span><strong style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">地之阴</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;">”——</span><em style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><strong>少阴</strong></span></em><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;text-indent: 0em;">。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7607361963190185" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcv7uzQV87XTia486ltxU8wpmABiaW803cIheT4drAetUxGNHXw8ibKzgDaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="720" data-width="85%" style="box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 85%;" width="85%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">阴茶相反，越放越浓，越放越香，气不断往里收，成分不断在积累</span></strong></span><span style="font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">。就比如说普洱，大家都知道讲年份的。老白茶、黄茶也讲年份，越久越好。</span><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">阳茶却是越放越淡，所以要越早喝越好</span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: #3E3E3E;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">，像龙井等，第</span>2年的口感肯定不如第一年的。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">冲泡方面，阴茶比如白茶必须闷煮，温度一定要水烧开；阳茶一般</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">90</span>度，温度不易过高。</span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">经过多年的冲泡，我发现了一个</span><em><strong style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">低温冲泡法</span></strong></em><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">，可以又好看又有营养物质。</span><em><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">就是常温水冲泡，等过了</span>30分钟以上再加温热水，泡出来的好看，营养物质更好。但这个需要时间，心急喝不上好茶</span><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">。</span></strong></span></em></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107457" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="box-sizing: border-box;width: 50px;height: 50px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;margin: auto;transform: rotate(0deg);"><section style="font-size: 18px;letter-spacing: 0px;color: #000;line-height: 50px;" hm_fix="277:533"><em><strong>06</strong></em></section></section><section style="display: inline-block;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);padding: 15px;margin-top: -25px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;line-height: 1.6em;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);"><span style="color: rgb(227, 108, 9);font-size: 17px;"><strong>经络与子午流注</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">喝茶讲究功效，茶的功效走经络。</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">阳脉从手到头、从头到脚，它是往下走的。阴脉是从脚到胸、从胸到手，是往上走的。</span><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">喝了阳茶，体液往下流；喝了阴茶，体液往上流。</span></span></strong></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">现在的人，火往往在上面，水往下走，经常出现上火、心脑血管疾病、心肾不交、失眠等症状。所以喝点白茶引水上行，可以防止心脑血管疾病，让人脑聪目明。</span></strong></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><img class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6197916666666666" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcveRDaKBvFR1CHMWV72FKM5mo6JEscDGic616ibaxmnaXjicgP6p38L4s3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="720" data-width="85%" style="vertical-align: inherit;width: 85%;" width="85%"  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">经络是一种特殊的结构，这个结构就是细胞间质通道，它是由很多的胶原蛋白构成的纤维束，一束束纤维构成的。这个纤维束对于特定波段的红外辐射有单向全透过的功效，而纤维束之间有大量的水分和有机大分子可以迅速流过。</span><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">身体的五脏六腑、皮肤肌肉组织里面，到处都是这样的东西有规律地分布着，而且纤维束外面还包着一层细胞的外皮层。</span></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="caret-color: red;font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><span style="color: #3E3E3E;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">经络和血管还不一样：血管是中通的，完全连通；经络不是，经络是一段一段的、是实心的，既有光纤，又有外面的皮，一段一段中间有细胞隔着。这些隔着的细胞通过跨膜蛋白通道连接着。</span><strong><span style="color: #3E3E3E;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;">所以这些跨膜通道平时锁着，钥匙就在我们喝的茶和草药里面。</span></strong></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><img align="bottom" border="0" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6432291666666666" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvjoHuDB8Bga2rSOLozGjZN0cMDD0YAqm4OyVPgtUwzIicd4rxHbicawMQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="384" height="356" style="vertical-align:middle;" width="554"  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">我们每个人身体里有<em><span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><strong>子午流注</strong></span></em>，</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">每两个小时就有一条经络打开。</span><span style="font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">太阴脾经对应已时，所以早上</span>9-11点喝白茶对身体最好，能健脾造血</span></span></strong><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">。爱美的女性朋友这个时候可以喝点白茶，肯定比把钱花在化妆品上的效果要好。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">气血足的女性眼神一定是明亮的，化妆品再好，无法美化我们的眼球。你美不美看眼睛，没有明亮的眼睛，你再好看也是一张纸。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><img align="bottom" border="0" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7317708333333334" data-src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z3eD0D5PEy9GZMzmqVVfDVD0SXWbXGcvyYycGk4PHZbiaVqh2dukiaFJpibPpfBzpdRRClfiaVm0ym87BicVBrpM0zw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-type="jpeg" data-w="384" height="406" style="vertical-align:middle;" width="554"  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;">我们一些研究机构做了些科学实验，<span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">试了很多草药，最后发现还是茶厉害。</span><strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">茶的效应比所有的草药都强，但不是所有的茶都能归经的</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;">大家可以看到<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">白茶、白毫银针作用在肺上面，寿眉作用在脾上面，所以脾脏就出来了</span>。</span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">但要注意一点，</span><strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);background: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">一定是最好的茶才能归经，</span><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">那些好茶又甜又香又通透</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">。一个好茶除了好料，最重要的是谁做的茶。大师就是大师，大师是非“冰冻三尺，非一日之寒；水滴石穿，非一日之功”可以铸就的，而现在的大师越来越少了。</span></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107463" style="margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;"><section style="display: inline-block;margin-right: 3px;margin-left: 3px;"><section style="border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(254, 117, 0) 0%, rgb(255, 252, 249) 100%);background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;padding: 7px 22px;transform: translate(-3px, -3px);" hm_fix="310:250"><section data-brushtype="text" style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #000;"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">三<span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">、</span>吃茶去</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">最后希望我们每个人都能每天在百忙中，跟家人跟友人喝点茶、听首古琴曲、闻闻香。</span><strong><span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">最好每天都静坐一下，让心能沉淀一下</span></strong><span style="background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">。</span><span style="font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5pt;caret-color: red;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">不要总是找那么多理由：白天我很忙，回家就是吃饭电视手机。那不是我们真正的生活，那远离了我们真正的生活。</span><br  /></span></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><br  /></p><p style="vertical-align: inherit;margin-bottom: 0in;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.5px;margin-left: 0.5em;margin-right: 0.5em;"><span style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">更多养身知识欢迎关注<span style="letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;">公众号：</span></span><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1.5pt;background: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;font-family: 宋体, SimSun;">医行天下处处自在。</span></strong></p><section class="mp_profile_iframe_wrp"><mpprofile class="js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe" data-pluginname="mpprofile" data-id="MzA3NzI5MjEzOA==" data-headimg="http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Z3eD0D5PEy99cTx5u7libzzgWs4jUicGib6D6y5iczGJu0Xm47uHUic7O7M3d8UEmKFUTlMia